#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-suite-hub.php
msgid ""
"Registry and health overview of the WM Suite plugins, a CycloneDX 1.6 "
"software bill of materials and an audit table whose entries are chained with "
"HMAC-SHA256."
msgstr ""
"Reġistru u ħarsa ġenerali lejn is-saħħa tal-plugins ta’ WM Suite, lista ta’ "
"komponenti tas-softwer CycloneDX 1.6 u tabella tal-awditjar li l-entrati "
"tagħha huma marbuta f’katina b’HMAC-SHA256."

